===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|fi}} {{m|fiu-fin-pro|*kotka}}, from {{etyl|fiu-fpr-pro|fi}} {{m|urj-pro|*kočka}}. Cognates include Livvi {{m|olo|kotku}}, Estonian {{m|et|kotkas}}, Northern Sami {{m|se|goaskin}}, Komi {{m|kpv|куч}}.

